# =============================================================================
# Build-context ignore rules for deploy/docker/Dockerfile.* (context = repository root).
#
# Docker reads ignore rules from TWO places only: `.dockerignore` at the ROOT of the build
# context, or — with BuildKit — a file named `<Dockerfile-name>.dockerignore` next to the
# Dockerfile. This file is the single source of truth; Dockerfile.edge.dockerignore and
# Dockerfile.control.dockerignore next to it are verbatim copies that BuildKit actually applies.
# Keep the three identical (deploy/README.md has a one-liner that checks this).
# =============================================================================

# Version control and editors
.git
.github
.vs
.vscode
.idea
**/*.user
**/*.swp

# Build output — everything is rebuilt inside the image
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
**/artifacts
**/publish
**/TestResults
**/*.binlog
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts

# Node: fetched with npm ci in the spa stage; dist is produced there
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
src/Dle.Control/wwwroot/admin

# Not needed for either image
tests
docs
sdk
deploy/aspire
deploy/helm
deploy/k6
deploy/postgres
deploy/*.yml
deploy/.env
deploy/.env.*
deploy/Caddyfile
deploy/geoip
*.md
!src/Dle.Admin.Web/README.md
LICENSE

# Local secrets and databases
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/*.mmdb
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.pem
